# One entry per container image this updater imports on activation: the
# manifest component key, the release-payload env file it cross-checks
# against that component, the release-payload OCI tar it `docker load`s,
# and the three key names read out of that env file. Pi-hole, llama.cpp,
# and SearXNG are all unconditionally embedded in every base image and
# every release bundle (see image-builder/sovereign/*-image.env), so all
# three are required components, not optional ones.
